  "metaDescription": "Former KPU chairman Hasyim Asy'ari stated the exception clause in PKPU regulations was not created specifically for Gibran Rakabuming Raka's candidacy.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Hasyim Asy'ari denied allegations that a 2023 electoral regulation was modified to benefit Gibran Rakabuming Raka's eligibility.",
